@startuml
[*] --> Idle : Card Inserted / Get PIN

state Idle
state WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state WaitingForChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN
WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForChoice : Correct PIN / Display Options
WaitingForChoice --> Ejecting : Cancel Operation / Return Card
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Too Many Incorrect Tries / Keep Card

state Confiscating : entry / Keep Card Secure
state Ejecting : entry / Return Card

@enduml
